  "description": "The heart of the people is the heart of heaven, and what is for the people is the way of heaven. The greatest power to rule the world is not a blood-soaked sword, but the musical rhythm that comforts the hearts of the people! Here is a man who rises up to the world with a flute in his hand! Martial arts and sound! The path of the true absolute powerhouse, revered as a legendary warrior of the time, unfolds!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
